+- **UX-18 — Authoring and annotations:** Ordinary single/multiple/ordering/fill editors exclude the separate Polls editor. Keep partially invalid input and distinguish an empty new slot from a cleared existing question. Fill blanks and translation-protection ranges bind exact revision/field/occurrence; edits and undo/redo keep text and annotations together, removing a mark preserves text, and repeated words are not globally marked. Fill retains 1–3 distinct blanks and 5/10 unique candidates. Translation protection is a shared step after generating the whole lesson and is distinct from blank/correctness. Player/exam projections must redact answer-revealing metadata. Sources: EXPERIENCE authoring, DESIGN editor components, AD-27. Shared serialization/indexing/migration is the O6 adapter prerequisite; HTML does not choose it.
 
