+- **UX-19 — Competition phases and prizes:** «Турнир» names qualification, «Чемпионат» the final bracket/matches, and «Соревнование» both. Downloading the corresponding course **or** a valid link permits new course-qualification entry only in server `[qualification.startsAtMs, qualification.endsAtMs)`; no manual whitelist is required. The link does not bypass finalist selection. This interval does not apply to a standalone private quiz. Dynamic prize-place rows sum to the reserved fund; use confirmed payouts and return the remainder, without restoring the old two-third-place formula. Pair proposals and each participant's confirmation are authoritative: radio choice is not confirmation and the mutually agreed slot is immutable. Sources: EXPERIENCE UJ-5/6, handoff O2/O3, AD-17. Shared prize, admission and meeting-read contracts remain required before their adapters.
