+- **UX-20 — Gifts and own-operation history:** Keep the automatic ordinary box after 10 consecutive days distinct from the available Premium gift obtained by explicit «Получить подарок» without watching ads. Source limits remain; Premium is not unlimited or a second automatic login grant. Online box opening returns the same stored reward on retry. Preserve Premium's full purchase price versus normalized comparison, nickname appearance and both ×2 regenerations. General own history via drawer and author lesson «Начисления» share an authorized read projection: date groups, All/Income/Expense filters, expanded record, signed amount/resource/status. Pending is not earned; resources are not summed together; empty/loading/error differ. Reading history neither executes money commands nor reveals secrets. Sources: EXPERIENCE UJ-7/F9, DESIGN history, AD-19/30; CAP-26. O10 fixes permitted fields and bounded continuation before adapters.
+
+- **UX-21 — Online timing:** The authoritative active-question deadline continues through network loss; expiry without a timely accepted answer records unanswered under mode scoring, never paid-correct. If another question remains, the captured shared server window, default 60 seconds, starts at a timely accepted answer or the original deadline, not disconnect/reconnect/retry/late worker. It is not extra answer time, is not reset and is absent after the last question; ready content appears immediately. Preserve the separate bounded first-ACK contract and accepted ordinary/Arena offline flows. AD-31 controls terminal mode outcomes and next-question timing. ONLINE-O1 must reconcile the full window with existing competition fixed `endsAt`; ONLINE-O2 must define shared delivery/ready-ACK and next-clock boundaries. No client-local choice may silently resolve either prerequisite.
